Description: fullscreen living-room launcher for GNOME
 Salon presents installed applications, games, commands, and web apps as
 large tiles designed to be read from a sofa. It can be controlled with a
 gamepad, keyboard, HDMI-CEC remote, mouse, or a phone on the local network.
 .
 The native package includes optional GNOME Shell and GNOME Kiosk login
 sessions in addition to the regular desktop application.
